00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:52.360
And don't get me wrong.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:58.580
I like that. There's the continuous scroll of like, that there isn't just keep going forward and forward.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:02.340
I do like that you're able to go around, but it gets very messy very quickly.

