to stop on a dime or, uh, you know, avoid your certain, um, your certain depth from,

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:15.840
yeah, from those, from those different ships that are shooting things at you.

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:18.180
Uh, and there's a wide variety of different enemies.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.760
Right. And I think the inertia thing, I think it's really cool.

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:22.120
And I, and I do think it would have been cool.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:26.380
Like Sean said, if they leaned into it more and made it a lot more, uh, with gravity too.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:30.800
Right. But the, um, I think the problem, not even that it's necessarily a problem, but I think

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:34.360
just for us who've all played it like once or twice, I think the problem is probably

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.620
that like, those don't really kick in and like how cool they are until you're really good

