at the game. And like, I feel like for us, it's just like, it just makes more sense to just take it slowly

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:43.380
because you can. Yeah.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:49.000
Well, I see that I agree that I definitely think like a good player could be better at this.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:54.060
Like feel like a bad, but I wonder, but I wonder if the fact that, and keep in mind that this

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.720
is a, this is a port that definitely like remove things.

